{"instance_id":"pallets__click-3145","agent":{"result":"done","turns":18,"status":"done","files_changed":["src/click/core.py","tests/test_defaults.py"],"fix_summary":"## 修复说明\n\n**根因**：`Context.lookup_default` 使用 `self.default_map.get(name)`，当映射中存在键但值为内部哨兵 `UNSET`（如 `{\"port\": UNSET}`）时，会原样返回 `UNSET`；而下游 `Parameter.get_default` / `consume_value` 仅判断 `value is None` 与键是否存在，因此把 `UNSET` 当成有效默认值，导致 `--port` 得到 `None` 而非参数自身的 `8000`。\n\n**修复**（`src/click/core.py`，与原上游修复一致）：\n\n1. 新增 `Context._default_map_has(name)` 辅助方法：仅当 `name` 非空、`default_map` 非 `None`、键存在且其值 **不是** `UNSET` 时返回 `True`。\n2. `lookup_default` 改为：若 `_default_map_has(name)` 为假则返回 `None`（`UNSET` 视为“键不存在”，从而不影响任何重写 `lookup_default` 的子类行为）；否则取出真实值，必要时调用可调用默认值。\n3. `Parameter.get_default` 与 `Parameter.consume_","llm_evidence":"model=deepseek/deepseek-flash turns=18 transcript_bytes=66940 | tokens=140726（p=133148 c=7578 r=5236）","token_usage":{"llm_calls":18,"prompt_tokens":133148,"completion_tokens":7578,"reasoning_tokens":5236,"total_tokens":140726,"per_call":[{"call":1,"prompt_tokens":1505,"completion_tokens":86,"reasoning_tokens":8},{"call":2,"prompt_tokens":1904,"completion_tokens":90,"reasoning_tokens":10},{"call":3,"prompt_tokens":3427,"completion_tokens":89,"reasoning_tokens":11},{"call":4,"prompt_tokens":4326,"completion_tokens":61,"reasoning_tokens":0},{"call":5,"prompt_tokens":4869,"completion_tokens":195,"reasoning_tokens":121},{"call":6,"prompt_tokens":5918,"completion_tokens":1083,"reasoning_tokens":1010},{"call":7,"prompt_tokens":6158,"completion_tokens":624,"reasoning_tokens":567},{"call":8,"prompt_tokens":6565,"completion_tokens":856,"reasoning_tokens":786},{"call":9,"prompt_tokens":7455,"completion_tokens":757,"reasoning_tokens":663},{"call":10,"prompt_tokens":7619,"completion_tokens":78,"reasoning_tokens":13},{"call":11,"prompt_tokens":9113,"completion_tokens":1390,"reasoning_tokens":1297},{"call":12,"prompt_tokens":9636,"completion_tokens":128,"reasoning_tokens":47},{"call":13,"prompt_token