{"instance_id":"pallets__click-3105","agent":{"result":"done","turns":9,"status":"done","files_changed":["src/click/types.py","tests/test_types.py"],"fix_summary":"Oracle passed (exit 0, 21/21 tests).\n\n## 修复说明\n\n**根因**：`src/click/types.py` 中 `FuncParamType.convert` 捕获 `ValueError` 后，把原始输入 `value`（转换失败的值本身，如 `\"nope\"`）传给 `self.fail(...)`，丢弃了异常携带的语义化错误说明。\n\n**修改**（`FuncParamType.convert`）：\n```python\ntry:\n    return self.func(value)\nexcept ValueError as e:\n    message = str(e)\n\n    if not message:\n        try:\n            message = str(value)\n        except UnicodeError:\n            message = value.decode(\"utf-8\", \"replace\")\n\n    self.fail(message, param, ctx)\n```\n\n- 捕获异常实例并 `str(e)` 作为失败消息，满足验收标准 1、2；\n- 当异常消息为空字符串时，回退到原行为（序列化 `value` → `\"nope\"`），保证 `(\"\", \"nop","llm_evidence":"model=deepseek/deepseek-flash turns=9 transcript_bytes=39068 | tokens=47974（p=45202 c=2772 r=1534）","token_usage":{"llm_calls":9,"prompt_tokens":45202,"completion_tokens":2772,"reasoning_tokens":1534,"total_tokens":47974,"per_call":[{"call":1,"prompt_tokens":1400,"completion_tokens":159,"reasoning_tokens":0},{"call":2,"prompt_tokens":2485,"completion_tokens":75,"reasoning_tokens":9},{"call":3,"prompt_tokens":2836,"completion_tokens":542,"reasoning_tokens":415},{"call":4,"prompt_tokens":4725,"completion_tokens":325,"reasoning_tokens":176},{"call":5,"prompt_tokens":6315,"completion_tokens":433,"reasoning_tokens":188},{"call":6,"prompt_tokens":6679,"completion_tokens":517,"reasoning_tokens":424},{"call":7,"prompt_tokens":6800,"completion_tokens":305,"reasoning_tokens":239},{"call":8,"prompt_tokens":6894,"completion_tokens":151,"reasoning_tokens":83},{"call":9,"prompt_tokens":7068,"completion_tokens":265,"reasoning_tokens":0}]},"bench_calls":13,"pass_at_1":true,"f2p_passed":"1/1"},"phase_a":{"result":"validated","rounds":2}}
